cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its result files, please cite the archived release."
title: "Adversarial Robustness of Mamba-Based Network Intrusion Detection: Code and Results"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artefact for a controlled comparison of a selective
  state-space (Mamba/S6) intrusion detector against Transformer,
  one-dimensional convolutional, bidirectional recurrent and Random Forest
  baselines on NSL-KDD, NF-UNSW-NB15-v2 and CSE-CIC-IDS2018, under white-box
  (FGSM, PGD) and black-box transfer attacks over seven random seeds. The
  repository contains the pipeline, the verification notebooks and every
  result file on which the reported tables and figures are based.
